OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStudents react to GCSE results as
OL,4,Aregional gap widens in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildhood best friends Jessie and Ellie
OL,7,Fare relieved with their grades,
OL,8,Fthanking their "amazing teacher, Miss
OL,9,FEvie", as Isla says she's "smashed" her
OL,10,Fresults and is celebrating with a
OL,11,Ffamily trip to Ibiza
OL,13,FNot everyone getting their results is a
OL,14,Fteenager - with 52-year-old grandmother
OL,15,FWynne and Joanne, 56, both passing
OL,16,Ftheir maths exam
OL,18,FOur team of experts have been answering
OL,19,Fyour questions - giving advice on
OL,20,Fthings like getting your paper remarked
OL,21,Fand if you don't have a plan yet
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
